WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.424
Vinnie followed Mei-Li through the city.

2
00:00:04.425 --> 00:00:08.273
"Chang’an is so big!" said Vinnie.

3
00:00:08.274 --> 00:00:10.124
Mei-Li nodded.

4
00:00:10.125 --> 00:00:13.541
"Chang’an is the capital of the Tang Dynasty.

5
00:00:13.542 --> 00:00:16.471
The famous Silk Road begins here.

6
00:00:16.472 --> 00:00:20.871
Almost all trade moves along the Silk Road."

7
00:00:20.872 --> 00:00:27.215
"Oh, that’s why there are so many different people here," said Vinnie.

8
00:00:27.216 --> 00:00:33.077
They passed a very high wall with a guarded gate.

9
00:00:33.078 --> 00:00:36.623
"That’s the East Gate," said Mei-Li.

10
00:00:36.624 --> 00:00:40.414
"We have four gates, but we can use only three."

11
00:00:40.415 --> 00:00:43.202
"Why?" asked Vinnie.

12
00:00:43.203 --> 00:00:47.611
"The North Gate is only for the emperor," said Mei-Li.

13
00:00:47.612 --> 00:00:50.418
"Where is Mandy?"

14
00:00:50.419 --> 00:00:54.545
"She’s wandered off again," sighed Vinnie.

15
00:00:54.546 --> 00:00:58.818
"Don’t worry, she does this all the time."

16
00:00:58.819 --> 00:01:04.103
Meanwhile, the monkey ran fast out of the square.

17
00:01:04.104 --> 00:01:08.407
Then it climbed up on the roof of a building.

18
00:01:08.408 --> 00:01:12.614
"Come here," she called to the animal.

19
00:01:12.615 --> 00:01:17.072
The monkey shyly moved down to a windowsill.

20
00:01:17.073 --> 00:01:20.619
Mandy carefully climbed up some steps.

21
00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:23.473
She tried to grab the monkey.

22
00:01:23.474 --> 00:01:27.869
But she tripped and tumbled through a door.

23
00:01:27.870 --> 00:01:31.941
"I’m terribly sorry,"

24
00:01:31.942 --> 00:01:36.183
she apologized to a startled young man.

25
00:01:36.184 --> 00:01:40.069
He was sitting cross-legged on a low couch.

26
00:01:40.070 --> 00:01:45.366
In front of him was a low table covered with open books.

27
00:01:45.367 --> 00:01:48.615
"May I help you?" he asked.

28
00:01:48.616 --> 00:01:51.975
"Well, yes," Mandy said.

29
00:01:51.976 --> 00:01:54.672
"I’m looking for a monkey."

30
00:01:54.673 --> 00:01:58.356
"Are you sure it’s here?" he laughed.

31
00:01:58.357 --> 00:02:01.947
Mandy nodded. "I chased it here."

32
00:02:01.948 --> 00:02:05.618
She explained the trainer’s behavior.

33
00:02:05.619 --> 00:02:08.022
The man nodded sadly.

34
00:02:08.023 --> 00:02:10.534
"We should treat all living things kindly.

35
00:02:10.535 --> 00:02:12.404
That’s Buddha’s way."

36
00:02:12.405 --> 00:02:16.139
"Who are you?" asked Mandy.

37
00:02:16.140 --> 00:02:17.796
"My name is Jinying.

38
00:02:17.797 --> 00:02:21.411
I am Master Yuan’s son," he replied.

39
00:02:21.412 --> 00:02:25.636
"How come you aren’t at your party?" she asked.

40
00:02:25.637 --> 00:02:29.014
"My father is a little too eager to celebrate.

41
00:02:29.015 --> 00:02:34.137
My exams are not over yet," laughed Jinying.

42
00:02:34.138 --> 00:02:37.757
"I still have many Chinese characters to memorize."

43
00:02:37.758 --> 00:02:42.412
"How many do you have to know?" asked Mandy.

44
00:02:42.413 --> 00:02:45.625
She glanced at his open book.

45
00:02:45.626 --> 00:02:51.936
She saw a vertical row of Chinese characters on one side of the page.

46
00:02:51.937 --> 00:02:57.465
Next to each character was a series of smaller characters.

47
00:02:57.466 --> 00:03:01.938
"I memorize about two hundred a day," replied Jinying.

48
00:03:01.939 --> 00:03:04.410
"Each character has a different meaning."

49
00:03:04.411 --> 00:03:10.149
"How many do you have to learn altogether?" Mandy asked.

50
00:03:10.150 --> 00:03:16.400
"Over four hundred thousand." Jinying sighed.

51
00:03:16.401 --> 00:03:18.558
Mandy was shocked.

52
00:03:18.559 --> 00:03:22.551
"I won’t disturb you then," she said.

53
00:03:22.552 --> 00:03:26.293
"Wait!" Jinying stood up and stretched.

54
00:03:26.294 --> 00:03:27.677
"I need a break.

55
00:03:27.678 --> 00:03:30.887
I’ll help you find your monkey."

56
00:03:30.888 --> 00:03:36.070
Meanwhile, Vinnie stopped and stared at the crowded streets.

57
00:03:36.071 --> 00:03:40.134
"This is like New York!" he cried.

58
00:03:40.135 --> 00:03:43.215
"Excuse me?" asked Mei-Li.

59
00:03:43.216 --> 00:03:46.866
"Uh, nothing," he said.

60
00:03:46.867 --> 00:03:53.138
Chang’an was busy and noisy with people, wagons, and animals.

61
00:03:53.139 --> 00:03:59.631
When he and Mei-Li reached the market, Vinnie was even more surprised.

62
00:03:59.632 --> 00:04:05.808
There were many lanes, and each lane sold only one product.

63
00:04:05.809 --> 00:04:11.458
"Wow! There’s one lane for oil, and one lane for vegetables.

64
00:04:11.459 --> 00:04:21.066
And even one," Vinnie laughed, "for roast duck with the head still attached?"

65
00:04:21.067 --> 00:04:24.806
"My favorite!" said Mei-Li.

66
00:04:24.807 --> 00:04:28.276
"The duck seems to be looking at me!"

67
00:04:28.277 --> 00:04:31.744
"But it’s delicious!" she replied.

68
00:04:31.745 --> 00:04:33.609
"Let’s try some."

69
00:04:33.610 --> 00:04:35.206
Vinnie gulped.

70
00:04:35.207 --> 00:04:44.447
"Maybe I should go and find my sister."

